# **`costs/*.json` are generated data files, so their line endings are pinned.**
#
# Nothing compares them byte for byte any more — `tests/cost_scenarios.rs`
# checks that they parse and round-trip, not that they match a serialiser — so
# this is hygiene rather than a correctness requirement. What it buys is that a
# regeneration on Windows does not rewrite every line of every file with a
# different newline and produce a diff that is entirely invisible.
costs/*.json text eol=lf
